Problem description
Dtype::scalar_type currently is defined as tensorexpr::ScalarType
// Switch to PT/Aten dtypes
enum class ScalarType : int8_t {
#define DEFINE_ENUM(_1, n) n,
  AT_FORALL_SCALAR_TYPES_WITH_COMPLEX_AND_QINTS(DEFINE_ENUM)
#undef DEFINE_ENUM
  // Undefined must be next to match c10::ScalarType;
  Undefined,
  Handle,
  Uninitialized,
  None,
  NumOptions
};

Since c10::ScalarType defines more utility functions than tensorexpr::ScalarType, some times one needs to explicitly do static_cast<c10::ScalarType>(...). @bertmaher suggested to replace make tensorexpr::Dtype::scalar_type to use c10::ScalarType directly (see the discussion here.
